                      acc.email,
                      style: const TextStyle(
                        fontSize: 12,
                        color: Color(0xFF94A3B8),
                      ),
                    ),
                    trailing: const Icon(Icons.arrow_forward_ios, size: 13, color: Color(0xFFFF8DA1)),
